          "size": 2649322,
          "released": "2026-10-07",
          "notes": "New: Choose channels (keep, drop, reorder, recolour and rename channels; pixels copied exactly). Read image reads WebP, AVIF and JPEG 2000 and records whether the file is lossless, lossy or may be lossy, warning when pixels are lossy. A single coloured channel is drawn in its colour in every picture. Needs Rill 0.4.0.",
