          "size": 4719143,
          "released": "2026-10-07",
          "notes": "Compose figure: text, lines, arrows, rectangles and ellipses on the page; A B C panel letters with Relabel; local chart edits (double-click a chart panel to restyle it for this figure only). Items keep their place in points; anything cut at or off the page edge is warned about. Edit figure: text items gain a Weight control. Needs Rill 0.4.0.",
